---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-[var(--blog-hairline)] mt-16 px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-16">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-10">
        <!-- Marca + bio -->
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-[340px]">
            <a href="/" aria-label="Ir a ZenithSeed" title="Ir a ZenithSeed" class="wm group flex items-center gap-2 w-fit">
                <span class="text-[var(--blog-accent)] font-extrabold text-xl leading-none">&gt;</span>
                <span class="font-extrabold text-lg leading-none tracking-tight"><span class="text-[var(--blog-ink)]">Zenith</span><span class="text-[var(--blog-accent)]">Blog</span></span>
            </a>
            <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--blog-ink-muted)]">
                Lo técnico sin humo y los juegos que me marcan. Esto es solo una parte de lo que hago, el resto está en ZenithSeed.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Enlaces -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-12 md:gap-16 text-[14px]">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--blog-ink-muted)]">Navegar</span>
                <a href="/" class="text-[var(--blog-ink)] hover:text-[var(--blog-accent)] transition-colors">ZenithSeed</a>
                <a href="/porfolio" class="text-[var(--blog-ink)] hover:text-[var(--blog-accent)] transition-colors">Portfolio</a>
                <a href="/blog" class="text-[var(--blog-ink)] hover:text-[var(--blog-accent)] transition-colors">Blog</a>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--blog-ink-muted)]">Proyectos</span>
                <a href="/projects/games" class="text-[var(--blog-ink)] hover:text-[var(--blog-accent)] transition-colors">Games</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto py-5 border-t border-[var(--blog-hairline)]">
        <p class="text-[12px] text-[var(--blog-ink-muted)]">© {year} Álvaro Sebastián Acosta</p>
    </div>
</footer>
